" jour(s) après la demande. ⚠️ Art. 1068.2 al. 2 : le syndicat doit "
"maintenant transmettre au propriétaire ce qu'il a fourni."
msgstr ""
"%(count)d document(s) provided to the promisor on %(date)s, %(days)d day(s) "
"after the request. ⚠️ Art. 1068.2 para. 2: the syndicate must now send the "
"owner what it provided."

