"                                pieces of information: the date of installation, the required\n"
"                                maintenance work with its frequency and its date, the\n"
"                                ordinary repairs and their date, the contracts for\n"
"                                carrying out the work, the warranty contracts in force, the\n"
"                                inspection or expert reports and the manufacturer's\n"
"                                manuals. The columns all exist; those not\n"
"                                shown are added through the optional-columns\n"
"                                button, to the right of the header."

