"Étude obtenue le %(date)s, sur la base du carnet « %(log)s ». Prochaine "
"étude au plus tard le %(next)s (art. 8 du règlement, minimalement tous les 5"
" ans). La base du fonds de prévoyance du syndicat passe aux recommandations "
"de l'étude (art. 1071 al. 3 C.c.Q.)."
msgstr ""
"Study obtained on %(date)s, on the basis of the log \"%(log)s\". Next study "
"no later than %(next)s (s. 8 of the regulation, at least every 5 years). The"
" basis of the syndicate's contingency fund moves to the study's "
"recommendations (art. 1071 para. 3 CCQ)."

